  "translation": "Na ol pikinini bilong Yisrael i tok long ol: Sapos ol i givim mipela long han bilong Yahwe long graun bilong Mitsrayim, taim mipela i stap klostu long pot bilong mit, na mipela i kaikai bret inap bel i pulap! Bilong wanem yu bringim mipela i go ausait long dispela wailbus, bilong kilim i dai olgeta man bilong dispela kongregesen wantaim hangre?",
